{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：17:35 2026-08-30 HKT<br/>發佈時間：17:35 2026-08-30 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：17:35 2026-08-30 HKT</p><p>今天除舉行沙田試閘嘉年華外，游達榮亦擇好時辰舉行季前馬房拜神儀式，到場馬主包括有「時時」系馬主王經緯、「顏色」系馬主顏為善、「泰坦」馬主岑健龍，「正義波」及「同心同樂」馬主蘇振雄及太太Mandy、兒子蘇志康等，周俊樂、布文、金誠剛、希威森、霍宏聲、艾兆禮、艾道拿也有出席。游達榮既望新馬季贏馬數目能超越上季，並能挑戰多些大賽。下周日開纙賽，游達榮將派遣「光年程祥」及「光輝歲月」上陣。</p><h2>按下圖睇更多相片：</h2><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/88e9dc07164e1df3e776cf1eaff09f58/2026-08/2e34c080-0f21-45ab-815a-37c1aada926f.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/6869454e6d4d818572e81c193df10c10/2026-08/4bfad3db-e536-4b0b-902b-f7ac135b77e3.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/aebbcb7ab45e938fe94be6ae59f79b0e/2026-08/6e9e6f59-ee79-4ed5-af98-c7dbf1423d23.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/681084f0d7df1905167862ab2ea8eb42/2026-08/8bba04ba-29df-4cc6-838a-8dd341e949f2.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/fd9715ca98ee9eae7f9c008a473dbbb6/2026-08/8c0c2097-e4cd-45c7-afbc-f11b979aa382.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/a1b25f1142730ea40483cc18199cff3e/2026-08/8fad42ab-0738-4ac8-ae6d-2fad0f6eb675.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/3255bf28b69528701abb4d0f6ffbaf5c/2026-08/24ab6ff5-2a9c-45ac-95e6-87c70e1a46a8.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e5e929e99ffb0aef5ea3f4be02a8f6b0/2026-08/26d02db6-2bbb-4cfa-9f50-042d8d088f02.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/3beaec74327abd05a554c1dadc1c71af/2026-08/331b77aa-2e20-46c6-92eb-e15cd747231c.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/bdeed49242fe1528f76279fd28710124/2026-08/915be25a-5a2a-4b08-96e1-d5f7b79501ac.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/323fc4215897fac0022ce67f86250bd7/2026-08/75585e3d-fef0-4773-b15e-7ef6cc04997b.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/3263d9a53a4955ab73b85746e3d18bbe/2026-08/43921098-2260-4eaa-8b1f-2